      "figure": {
        "svgShape": "productivity-figure",
        "parametricParams": {
          "family": "loop",
          "divisions": 3,
          "mark": 1
        }
      },
      "procedureFull": "1. When reaching a breaking point or completing a task, pause before switching to the next item.\n2. Open an interstitial journal note and quickly write down three plain-text bullet points:\n   * Exact timestamp and the precise task just completed.\n   * Immediate emotional/cognitive state and any unresolved concerns.\n   * The physical next action required for the upcoming task, broken down to be immediately actionable.\n3. Take a brief 60-second breathing pause.\n4. Start the next task by executing the exact step just written down.",
      "setupFull": "* 11:42 - FINISHED: Replaced JSON serializer with simdjson parser.\n  * STATE: Slight mental fatigue; concerned about edge cases in escaped Unicode.\n  * NEXT ACTION: Open tests/parser_tests.rs, run cargo test test_unicode_escape.\n* 11:43 - STARTING: Unicode escape test suite debugging.",
