      "procedureFull": "1. Turn off all desktop, mobile, and browser push notifications for communication apps.\n2. Set up two dedicated communication batch windows per day (e.g., 11:30–12:15 and 16:30–17:00).\n3. During these windows, work through inboxes systematically, processing messages to zero using the Two-Minute Rule.\n4. Close all communication applications completely outside these scheduled batch windows.",
      "setupFull": "Slack / Email Communication Protocol\n  * Notification Status: PERMANENTLY DISABLED\n  * Processing Window 1: 11:30 - 12:15 (Triage morning updates, unlock blockers)\n  * Processing Window 2: 16:30 - 17:00 (Final day sync, async project updates)\n  * Emergency Escalation: On-call PagerDuty route only",
